From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Harry Turton <harrisonturton@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 19:30:56 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add register_live_heap, so paged values can point into live
 heaps

A heap that stays in memory isn't deserialized, so values deserialized
later couldn't point into it. register_live_heap records a live heap's
values by header address, as if it had been deserialized.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/pagable.rs                              |  1 +
 src/pagable/starlark_deserialize_context.rs | 13 +++++++++++++
 src/values/layout/heap/arena.rs             | 16 ++++++++++++++++
 src/values/layout/heap/heap_type.rs         |  8 ++++++++
 4 files changed, 38 insertions(+)

